flowchart LR
  Browser[React Web App] --> API[Express API]
  Browser <-->|Socket.IO| API
  API --> Mongo[(MongoDB)]
  API --> Redis[(Redis / BullMQ)]
  Scheduler[Scheduler] --> Mongo
  Scheduler --> Redis
  Redis --> Worker[Monitor Worker]
  Worker --> Guard[SSRF Guard]
  Guard --> Target[Public API Target]
  Worker --> Mongo
  Redis --> Notify[Notification Worker]
  Notify --> SMTP[SMTP Provider]
